{"id":25,"slug":"25-the-details-va-summary-hoat-dong-the-nao","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Semantic","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Thẻ `<details>` và `<summary>` hoạt động thế nào?","question_en":"How do `<details>` and `<summary>` work?","answer_vi":"`<details>` là accordion **có sẵn trong browser**, không cần JS.\n\n```html\n<details name=\"faq\">                <!-- name: chỉ mở 1 cái tại một thời điểm -->\n  <summary>Có hoàn tiền không?</summary>\n  <p>Hoàn 100% trong 7 ngày đầu.</p>\n</details>\n\n<details open>                       <!-- mở sẵn -->\n  <summary>Điều khoản</summary>\n  <p>...</p>\n</details>\n```\n\n```css\ndetails > summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; }  /* bỏ mũi tên mặc định */\ndetails[open] > summary { font-weight: 600; }\n```\n\nLợi thế so với accordion tự viết: có sẵn bàn phím (Enter/Space), đúng vai trò cho screen reader, và **nội dung bên trong vẫn được Ctrl+F tìm thấy** — browser tự bung ra.\n\n```js\ndetailsEl.addEventListener('toggle', () => console.log(detailsEl.open))\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** đặt animation `height` cho phần nội dung sẽ không chạy vì browser toggle thẳng `display`. Dùng `::details-content` hoặc animate phần tử con thay vì chính `<details>`.","answer_en":"`<details>` is an accordion **built into the browser**, no JS required.\n\n```html\n<details name=\"faq\">                <!-- name: only one open at a time -->\n  <summary>Do you offer refunds?</summary>\n  <p>Full refund within the first 7 days.</p>\n</details>\n\n<details open>                       <!-- open by default -->\n  <summary>Terms</summary>\n  <p>...</p>\n</details>\n```\n\n```css\ndetails > summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; }  /* drop the default marker */\ndetails[open] > summary { font-weight: 600; }\n```\n\nWhat it gives you over a hand-rolled accordion: keyboard support (Enter/Space), the correct screen-reader role, and **content that Ctrl+F can still find** — the browser expands it for you.\n\n```js\ndetailsEl.addEventListener('toggle', () => console.log(detailsEl.open))\n```\n\n**Note:** animating the panel `height` does nothing, because the browser toggles `display` outright. Target `::details-content` or animate an inner wrapper instead of `<details>` itself.","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>&lt;details&gt;</code> là accordion <strong>có sẵn trong browser</strong>, không cần JS.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;details name=&quot;faq&quot;&gt;                &lt;!-- name: chỉ mở 1 cái tại một thời điểm --&gt;\n  &lt;summary&gt;Có hoàn tiền không?&lt;/summary&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Hoàn 100% trong 7 ngày đầu.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/details&gt;\n\n&lt;details open&gt;                       &lt;!-- mở sẵn --&gt;\n  &lt;summary&gt;Điều khoản&lt;/summary&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/details&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">details</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;faq&quot;</span>&gt;</span>                <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- name: chỉ mở 1 cái tại một thời điểm --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">summary</span>&gt;</span>Có hoàn tiền không?<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">summary</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>Hoàn 100% trong 7 ngày đầu.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">details</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">details</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">open</span>&gt;</span>                       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- mở sẵn --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">summary</span>&gt;</span>Điều khoản<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">summary</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">details</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"details &gt; summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; }  /* bỏ mũi tên mặc định */\ndetails[open] &gt; summary { font-weight: 600; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">details</span> &gt; <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">summary</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">list-style</span>: none; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">cursor</span>: pointer; }  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* bỏ mũi tên mặc định */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">details</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-attr\">[open]</span> &gt; <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">summary</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-weight</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">600</span>; }</code></pre></div><p>Lợi thế so với accordion tự viết: có sẵn bàn phím (Enter/Space), đúng vai trò cho screen reader, và <strong>nội dung bên trong vẫn được Ctrl+F tìm thấy</strong> — browser tự bung ra.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"detailsEl.addEventListener('toggle', () =&gt; console.log(detailsEl.open))\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">detailsEl.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;toggle&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(detailsEl.<span class=\"hljs-property\">open</span>))</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> đặt animation <code>height</code> cho phần nội dung sẽ không chạy vì browser toggle thẳng <code>display</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Dùng <code>::details-content</code> hoặc animate phần tử con thay vì chính <code>&lt;details&gt;</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>&lt;details&gt;</code> is an accordion <strong>built into the browser</strong>, no JS required.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;details name=&quot;faq&quot;&gt;                &lt;!-- name: only one open at a time --&gt;\n  &lt;summary&gt;Do you offer refunds?&lt;/summary&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Full refund within the first 7 days.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/details&gt;\n\n&lt;details open&gt;                       &lt;!-- open by default --&gt;\n  &lt;summary&gt;Terms&lt;/summary&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/details&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">details</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;faq&quot;</span>&gt;</span>                <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- name: only one open at a time --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">summary</span>&gt;</span>Do you offer refunds?<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">summary</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>Full refund within the first 7 days.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">details</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">details</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">open</span>&gt;</span>                       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- open by default --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">summary</span>&gt;</span>Terms<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">summary</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">details</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"details &gt; summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; }  /* drop the default marker */\ndetails[open] &gt; summary { font-weight: 600; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">details</span> &gt; <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">summary</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">list-style</span>: none; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">cursor</span>: pointer; }  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* drop the default marker */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">details</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-attr\">[open]</span> &gt; <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">summary</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-weight</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">600</span>; }</code></pre></div><p>What it gives you over a hand-rolled accordion: keyboard support (Enter/Space), the correct screen-reader role, and <strong>content that Ctrl+F can still find</strong> — the browser expands it for you.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"detailsEl.addEventListener('toggle', () =&gt; console.log(detailsEl.open))\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">detailsEl.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;toggle&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(detailsEl.<span class=\"hljs-property\">open</span>))</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Note:</strong> animating the panel <code>height</code> does nothing, because the browser toggles <code>display</code> outright.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Target <code>::details-content</code> or animate an inner wrapper instead of <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> itself.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — <details>","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/details"},{"label":"MDN — <summary>","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/summary"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/16-semantic-html-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Semantic HTML là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/17-su-khac-biet-giua-div-va-section-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa `<div>` và `<section>` là gì?"},{"url":"/q/18-article-va-section-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`<article>` và `<section>` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/19-header-footer-nav-main-aside-dung-khi-nao","title":"`<header>`, `<footer>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<aside>` dùng khi nào?"},{"url":"/q/20-figure-va-figcaption-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"`<figure>` và `<figcaption>` dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/21-mark-strong-em-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`<mark>`, `<strong>`, `<em>` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/22-the-time-duoc-su-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Thẻ `<time>` được sử dụng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/23-semantic-html-anh-huong-seo-nhu-the-nao","title":"Semantic HTML ảnh hưởng SEO như thế nào?"}]}